  "description" : "This story takes place in the fictional cultivation world of Yunyue Continent.\n　　At its peak, the continent was protected by five major sects: Huanxi Sha, Chixia Peak, Fengyin Manor, Wuchen Island, and Xuanyuan Sect, ensuring the flourishing of cultivation. However, to realize his ambitions, Yue Wuji, the sect leader of Xuanyuan Sect, instigated a world-destroying war! His brother, Yue Wubing, sacrificed himself to stop him. After the war, the four major sects recuperated and stabilized their order, steadily developing for two hundred years, once again reviving cultivation on Yunyue Continent and restoring it to its former prosperity. However, hidden opportunities and potential crises left over from the cataclysm are quietly buried within the continent, foreshadowing future events.\nsource: movie.douban.com/googletranslate",
